    title: 'Overtime', kind: 'garrison', biome: 'urban', mood: 0, tod: 'dawn', seed: 96811, diff: 4, pay: 190000, salv: 35, site: 'the Harlow works', op: 'DOUBLE TIME',
    tease: 'Keys Odhiambo is coming back to the Harlow works with the master code and most of a Red Maw company. Dutch is on shift, and FOREMAN builds to the order of the foreman on shift. For the first time in eleven years the line has an order: defend the works. Whatever comes off it this morning fights for you. Keep the machine hall standing and it will keep building. Lose it and the Maw gets the yard, the line, and four thousand machines with nobody in them.',
