      const r = await ask(dutch, "That's them seen off. So. She'll build till the sun goes out, boss, if nobody tells her otherwise, and I'm the only one she'll hear it from. I can tell her the order book's closed. I can give her to the Free League, for militia. Or she builds for us. I don't trust myself with it. You say.", ['Close the order book. Let her rest.', 'She builds for the Free League.', 'She builds for the yard.'], 30, 0); stSet('line', r + 1);
