    title: 'Line of Control', kind: 'recon', biome: 'desert', mood: 0, tod: 'day', seed: 97011, diff: 3, pay: 140000, salv: 25, site: 'the Sorrel line', op: 'WHITE FLAG',
    tease: 'Helion and Karsk have stopped shooting along the Sorrel line for the first time in thirty-one years, and are trying to make it permanent. Colonel Ferreira\'s Cobalt Lancers are monitoring the ceasefire and she has asked for a second monitor: somebody neither army likes, so that neither can say the monitors are bought. Somebody has been shelling both lines every night since. Each side says it is the other. Ferreira says it is neither, and wants the craters read before the truce is not there to save.',
